            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4) Department of Corrections must transport the employee to and from the testing site. The employee must be removed from duty until verified test results are received. If the test results are negative, the employee will be returned to work with back pay or the return of paid leave taken.",
            "block_bbox": [
                281,
